SUMMARY:GTApreneurs BizX 2026 Business Expo and Conference – VIP Ticket
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, you must **PURCHASE A TICKET** here: [https://gtapreneurs.com/bizx-
 business-expo-toronto](https://gtapreneurs.com/bizx-business-expo-toronto)
 \n\nYou are invited to an exciting mega networking bash! Join us on **Tues
 day\, October 20\, 2026** for **GTApreneurs’** **BizX 2026 Business Expo
  and Conference!** We expect 300+ small business owners and entrepreneurs 
 all looking to meet you and many others to do business together!\n\nMeet o
 ur sponsors and see what the event is all about.. [https://youtu.be/ohCqmt
 qyWpI?si=IoYai8NXOMVjX2Fl](https://youtu.be/ohCqmtqyWpI?si=IoYai8NXOMVjX2F
 l)\n\n**VENUE:** Hazelton Manor\n**ADDRESS:** 99 Peelar Rd\, Vaughan\, ON\
 n**PARKING:** Free\, onsite\n\n**VIP Ticket Itinerary:**\n\n* **9:00-10:30
 am:** CONTINENTAL BREAKFAST and Open Networking + visit Lobby & Conference
  Room Exhibitors\n* **10:30-10:45am:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\
 n* **10:45-11:00am:** Platinum and Gold Sponsor Introductions\n* **11:00-1
 1:20am:** **Nile Saïd** presentation\, ***"Your Business Has A Tell"***\n
 * **11:20-11:40am:** **Angie Nezarati** presentation\, ***“Your income w
 orks\, your capital doesn’t – yet”***\n* **11:40-12:00pm: Muhammad M
 urtaza Khan** presentation\, ***“Stop Guessing\, Start Growing: The Stra
 tegic Power of Cash Flow Forecasting.”***\n* **12:15- 2:00pm:** VIP Lunc
 h\n* **1:00-4:30pm:** BizX 2026 Business Expo (Main expo room)\n* **2:30-2
 :50pm:** **Bruno Teixeira** presentation\, ***"Where does AI actually save
  you hours?”***\n* **2:50-3:10pm:** **Helen Ching** presentation\, ***
 “Early bird gets the worm. Early planning accumulates significant busine
 ss wealth.”***\n* **4:30-5:00pm:** *Awards Ceremony:* ***Draw and awards
 *** given for **door prizes\, BizX 2026 Expo Contest and Exhibitor Draw**\
 n\n\\*\\*Snacks and refreshments served 1:00-4:30pm\n\n**VIP Ticket:**\n\n
 * $59 in advance or $69 on event day\n* GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhi
 bitor and Mega Networking Members: Free\n\n**Not a member?** Join us today
  >> [https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships](https://gtap
 reneurs.com/business-networking-memberships)\n\n**Book an exhibitor table 
 at BizX 2026\,** click here >> [https://gtapreneurs.com/product/bizx2026-b
 usiness-expo-exhibitor](https://gtapreneurs.com/product/bizx2026-business-
 expo-exhibitor)\n\n**Sponsor BizX 2026**\, send us a message >> info@gtapr
 eneurs.com\n\n**DOOR PRIZE RAFFLE:** Bring your business card and drop it 
 in the box for a chance to win a great prize.\n\n**BIZX 2026 BUSINESS EXPO
  CONTEST:** Each time you visit an exhibitor\, and exchange business cards
  (or exchange information electronically)\, they will put a sticker on you
 r event map. Fill your map with a sticker from every exhibitor to win a pr
 ize. At the end of the day (4:30-5:00pm)\, we will announce Expo Contest w
 inners as well as guest door prize winners and exhibitor draw winners.\n\n
 **SPONSORED BY:**\n\n* **Angie Nezarati**\, Everyday Business\, [www.every
 daybusiness.ca](www.everydaybusiness.ca)\n* **Balbir Pabila**\, PPLSI\\~Le
 galShield\, [https://bkpabila.legalshieldassociate.com](https://bkpabila.l
 egalshieldassociate.com)\n* **Bruno Teixeira**\, Aegis AI & Analytics Advi
 sory\, [https://aegisaianalytics.ca](https://aegisaianalytics.ca)\n* **Dan
 a Thomson**\, ADP\, [www.adp.com](www.adp.com)\n* **Helen Ching**\, Monai 
 Wealth\, [www.monaiwealth.com](www.monaiwealth.com)\n* **Michelina Dos San
 tos and Sonya Sokoliuk**\, The Mortgage Coach\, [https://themortgagecoach.
 ca](https://themortgagecoach.ca)\n* **Muhammad Khan**\, CFOs in Action\, [
 www.cfosinaction.com](www.cfosinaction.com)\n* **Nile Saïd**\, GoOneUp\, 
 [https://gooneup.co](https://gooneup.co)\n* **Sonia Kurmey**\, Arbonne\, [
 www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com](www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com)\n* **Svetlana Ra
 tnikova**\, IWB Immigrant Women in Business\, [https://immigrantwomeninbus
 iness](https://immigrantwomeninbusiness)
